  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent"><strong>Foods to Throw Away After a Power Outage</strong></span></h2><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Discard any perishable foods that have been above <strong>40°F for 2 hours or more</strong>.</h3><p class="isSelectedEnd" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">This includes:</p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Meat, poultry, seafood, and eggs</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Milk, yogurt, and other dairy products</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Soft cheeses</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Cut fruits and vegetables</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Cooked leftovers</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Deli meats</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Refrigerated prepared foods</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Opened containers of sauces, dressings, and spreads</p></li></ul><p class="isSelectedEnd" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Throw away food that:</p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Has an unusual odor, color, or texture</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Has come into contact with floodwater</p></li><li><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Has been sitting in unsafe temperatures for an unknown amount of time</p></li></ul><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Do not rely on appearance or smell alone. Some harmful bacteria do not change the taste, smell, or appearance of food.</p></div>


  
